msgid "Mark every edge whose two faces hand it different UVs -- what Blender's UV > Seams from Islands does, which on a tile are the borders between ortho cells. Computed on the datablock, so unlike the menu item it needs no edit mode round trip and no second copy of the mesh"
msgstr "标记两侧面 UV 不同的所有边——即 Blender 的 UV > 从孤岛标记缝合线 所做之事，在瓦片上就是正交单元之间的边界。在数据块上计算，因此与菜单项不同，无需往返编辑模式，也无需复制第二份网格"

